    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LA_1LB1RC_0LD0RB_1RA1LD [SWin 2; SCycL 2 0; SWin 4] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
